Column 0 renders [0, 4).
Column 1 renders [4, 8).
Pixel 0 renders [0, 4).
Pixel 1 renders [4, 8).

Verify column 0 affects only pixel 0 and column 1 affects only pixel 1. Verify column 0 does not bleed into pixel 1 merely because its end equals pixel 1’s start.
